          +1\cdot\frac{7}{216}+0\cdot\frac{1}{216}\\[2mm]
        &=\frac{95}{24}.
\end{aligned}
\]

Therefore  

\[
p=\frac{E[f(7-M)]}{36}= \frac{95}{24\cdot 36}= \frac{95}{864}.
\]

