                    # condition: not both neighbors of B are present in A
                    # compute (A shifted left 1) & (A shifted right 1) & B == 0
                    # shift left: bits at position r-1 become at r (since we want to check A_{r-1})
                    # Actually (A << 1) has bit r set if A_{r-1}=1 (since shift left moves lower bits to higher index)
                    # (A >> 1) has bit r set if A_{r+1}=1.
